        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Pale blue silk ground worked with polychrome silks in satin, long and short, stem, and couching stitches; landscape with bird, sheep, buildings, and at left Calvary with instruments of the Passion; upper center inked inscription: \nSopra il Monte dei dolori\nLa sua Vigna Iddio piantò:\nAlle Croci affisse i Cuori\nDi chi Spose a sè chiamò: \nE alla Croce del lor Bene\n con catene li legò."@en ;
